# @build: std
# A local `&mut` addresses lives in a frame slot, which keeps its address
# after a whole move (#2172), as a heap box does. Its whole path gets a
# `bool` flag local: each store sets it, the `Read move` clears it, and
# the slot's release at the round's end (or the next store's) runs only
# while it is set; a parameter's is set at the body's entry
# (`parameter`). A payload that only counts gets none (`counted`): the
# move zeroes it, so its release finds zeros. A slot no move empties gets
# none (`kept`). The checked runtime cases are in
# `std_rt/drop_tests.hd`.
